本仓库的内容按类型使用不同的许可：

- 题卡的结构化元数据（*.meta.json）、匿名的逐次记录、汇总统计：
  CC0 1.0，全文见 LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt
- 题卡文字（*.text.md）、查新报告、说明文档：
  CC BY-SA 4.0，全文见 LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
- Lean 题面（*.lean）：
  Apache-2.0，全文见 LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
- 从第三方导入的内容：保持原许可，在 REUSE.toml 里单独标注。

每个文件的许可以 REUSE.toml 为准（REUSE 规范：https://reuse.software/）。
"群星"的名称和标志不在以上任何许可之内。

---

This repository uses different licenses by content type:

- Structured card metadata (*.meta.json), anonymous per-run records and
  aggregated statistics: CC0-1.0 (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt)
- Card texts (*.text.md), novelty reports and documentation:
  CC-BY-SA-4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)
- Lean statements (*.lean): Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)
- Third-party content keeps its original license and is marked in REUSE.toml.

REUSE.toml is authoritative for per-file licensing.
The Qunxing name and logos are not licensed under any of these licenses.
